Using DAPO-Math-17k with only the final answer as a hint, Qwen3-1.7B self-distillation exhibits a response collapse. The student may learn to directly output the answer, bypassing the intermediate reasoning process. User Prompt \<|im_start|>user
I had $\$30$ in allowance money and spent it as indicated in the pie graph shown. How many dollars did I spend on burgers?

[asy]
size(1K);
pair A, B, C, D, O, W, X, Y, Z;
O=(0,0);
A=(.707,.707);
B=(-.966,.259);
C=(-.707,-.707);
D=(.342,-.940);
draw(Circle(O, 1));
draw(O--A);
draw(O--B);
draw(O--C);
draw(O--D);
W=(-.1,.5);
label("Movies", W, N);
label("$\frac{1}{3}$", W, S);
X=(-.55, 0);
label("Burgers", X, S);
Y=(-.17,-.7);
label("Ice Cream", Y, N);
label("$\frac{1}{5}$", Y, S);
Z=(.5, -.15);
label("Music", Z, N);
label("$\frac{3}{10}$", Z, S);
[/asy]

Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{}.<|im_end|>
 Assistant Response <|im_start|>assistant
<think>

</think>

$$
\boxed{7}
$$<|im_end|>
